    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skill doesn\u2019t matter! It\u2019s a thrilling card battle anyone can win!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take turns rolling four dice to complete combinations shown on their cards and launch attacks.<br>Match the right combo, and it\u2019s your big chance!<br>Will you deal massive damage, or draw extra cards to prepare for the next turn? The strategy is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With cards for attack, defense, and support, you\u2019ll need to master the <strong>keep and reroll</strong> system to play the perfect hand and gain the upper hand in battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A game system made for exciting multiplayer chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to <strong>four players</strong> can join the battle.<br>With three or more players, your attacks hit both neighbors, making the fight even faster and more intense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game progresses, new twists appear\u2014like using the previous player\u2019s dice roll\u2014turning every move into a game-changer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you're knocked out\u2026 your fight isn\u2019t over yet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Don\u2019t give up\u2014even when you\u2019re down! Ghost Mode is your revenge.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you\u2019re never really out.<br>Even after defeat, you can come back as a <strong>ghost</strong> to interfere with the living and seek revenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And with one miraculous roll\u2014if you land all the right faces\u2014you might just make a <strong>legendary comeback</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Luck is your ultimate weapon. Can you seize victory?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cWait, what!? They came back!?\u201d<br>\u201cNo way... that roll was insane!!\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect gasps, laughter, and jaw-dropping reversals in this wild card-and-dice battle where <i>no one\u2019s safe until the very end</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your shot and experience the thrill of a single roll turning the whole game upside down!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skill doesn\u2019t matter! It\u2019s a thrilling card battle anyone can win!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take turns rolling four dice to complete combinations shown on their cards and launch attacks.<br>Match the right combo, and it\u2019s your big chance!<br>Will you deal massive damage, or draw extra cards to prepare for the next turn? The strategy is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With cards for attack, defense, and support, you\u2019ll need to master the <strong>keep and reroll</strong> system to play the perfect hand and gain the upper hand in battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A game system made for exciting multiplayer chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to <strong>four players</strong> can join the battle.<br>With three or more players, your attacks hit both neighbors, making the fight even faster and more intense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game progresses, new twists appear\u2014like using the previous player\u2019s dice roll\u2014turning every move into a game-changer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you're knocked out\u2026 your fight isn\u2019t over yet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Don\u2019t give up\u2014even when you\u2019re down! Ghost Mode is your revenge.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you\u2019re never really out.<br>Even after defeat, you can come back as a <strong>ghost</strong> to interfere with the living and seek revenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And with one miraculous roll\u2014if you land all the right faces\u2014you might just make a <strong>legendary comeback</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Luck is your ultimate weapon. Can you seize victory?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cWait, what!? They came back!?\u201d<br>\u201cNo way... that roll was insane!!\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect gasps, laughter, and jaw-dropping reversals in this wild card-and-dice battle where <i>no one\u2019s safe until the very end</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your shot and experience the thrill of a single roll turning the whole game upside down!</p>",
    "short_description": "Match all the dice, and the comeback begins! With just dice and cards, up to 4 players face off in a thrilling battle. Match the dice shown on your card to attack \u2014 even if you're out, one last roll might turn it all around. Join the game of luck and strategy!",
